  "例3": {
    "anchor": "例3",
    "source_type": "textbook_example",
    "problem_text": "下列何者與\\(50{}^\\circ\\)互為同界角？\n(1)\\(-310{}^\\circ\\) (2)\\(770{}^\\circ\\) (3)\\(1250{}^\\circ\\)",
    "detailed_solution": "\\(\\o\\ac(○,解)\\) (1) \\(-310{}^\\circ -50{}^\\circ =-360{}^\\circ =360{}^\\circ \\times \\left ( { -1 } \\right )\\)\n 故\\(-310{}^\\circ\\)與\\(50{}^\\circ\\)互為同界角\n(2) \\(770{}^\\circ -50{}^\\circ =720{}^\\circ =360{}^\\circ \\times 2\\)\n故\\(770{}^\\circ\\)與\\(50{}^\\circ\\)互為同界角\n(3) \\(1250{}^\\circ -50{}^\\circ =1200{}^\\circ\\)不是\\(360{}^\\circ\\)的整數倍\n故\\(1250{}^\\circ\\)不是\\(50{}^\\circ\\)的同界角",
    "section_code": "1-1",
    "section_title": "1-1 角度的基本性質",
    "concept_code": "1-1.4",
    "concept_name": "同界角",
    "concept_en_id": "CoterminalAngles",
    "formal_skill_id": "vh_數學B2_CoterminalAngles",
